# Paper Live Dashboard Refresh

When refreshing the paper trading live dashboard, follow this pipeline:

## 1. Fetch live KPIs from VPS

Use Hermes VPS to run:

```bash
cd /opt/alpha-trade-oracle-bot && bash scripts/vps_export_paper_live.sh
```

Return only the raw pipe-delimited output (lines starting with META|, ACCOUNT|, STATUS|, WR|, EXIT|, TOP|, BOT|, OPEN|, PEND|).

## 2. Save snapshot

Write the output to `exports/paper_live_snapshot.txt` in the repo root.

## 3. Rebuild canvas

```bash
python scripts/build_paper_live_canvas.py
```

This updates:
`C:\Users\Admin\.cursor\projects\c-Users-Admin-Projects-alpha-trade-oracle-bot\canvases\paper-live-dashboard.canvas.tsx`

## 4. Confirm

Report the GENERATED timestamp and key KPIs (Equity, Realized PnL, Win Rate, Open/Closed counts).

Do not modify the canvas template manually unless the dashboard layout itself needs to change — always go through the build script.
